# Code owners for the Flux Community edition.
#
# GitHub reads this file from the default branch only — a change here does
# nothing until it lands on `main`.
#
# Ownership is routing, not a gate. Owner review is deliberately NOT required
# in branch protection: with a single owner, GitHub would refuse to let that
# owner approve their own pull request, and every PR would deadlock with no
# second person able to clear it. So this file auto-requests review and marks
# responsibility; the merge gate lives in branch protection settings.

